SUMMARY:🏋️ A 上肢日
URL:https://roxorlt.github.io/fitness-plan/day.html?d=2026-10-12
DESCRIPTION:📱 打卡页 https://roxorlt.github.io/fitness-plan/day.html?
 d=2026-10-12\n\n① 热身+核心 10-15分\n• 猫驼式\n  https://muscl
 ewiki.com/exercise/cat-pose\n• 臀桥\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise
 /glute-bridge\n• 死虫子\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise/dead-bug\n
 • 鸟狗式\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise/bird-dog\n• 侧桥\n  h
 ttps://musclewiki.com/exercise/elbow-side-plank\n\n② 力量 35-40分（
 每动作3×8-12，留2-3次余力）\n• 器械推胸\n  https://musclew
 iki.com/exercise/machine-chest-press\n• 或：哑铃卧推\n  https://mu
 sclewiki.com/exercise/dumbbell-bench-press\n• 高位下拉\n  https://mu
 sclewiki.com/exercise/machine-pulldown\n• 胸托支撑哑铃划船\n  ht
 tps://musclewiki.com/exercise/dumbbell-laying-incline-row\n• 坐姿哑
 铃推举(有靠背)\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise/dumbbell-seated-ov
 erhead-press\n• 面拉\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise/cable-rope-kne
 eling-face-pull\n• 哑铃弯举\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise/dumbb
 ell-curl\n• 绳索下压\n  https://musclewiki.com/exercise/cable-rope-p
 ushdown\n\n③ 椭圆机 25-30分\n• 椭圆机\n  https://musclewiki.com
 /exercise/elliptical\n\n⚠️ 护腰：不弓背、不憋气、疼痛立
 停
